        <activityName xml:lang="en">Ice storage tank with solar tube collector</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Ice storage tank with solar tube collector
Inventory for the production of an ice storage tank with solar tube collector with a life time of 20 years.;
Synonyms: Eisspeicher inkl. Solar Röhrenkollektor; 
UUID: 0eabf17e-d95c-3437-ac05-b2a4a64113b3
Infrastructure of the ice storage tank, including all material inputs (pipes concrete) plus the solar tube collector which is needed for the ice storage heating system. Also the energy use for building the storage tank with machines.
Location: Data apply to the supply in Switzerland.
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data provided by manufacturer 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_0eabf17e-d95c-3437-ac05-b2a4a64113b3.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
